{"seq":1,"slug":"schema-design-patterns","title":"图 Schema 设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/schema-design-patterns","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"图-schema-设计模式\">图 Schema 设计模式</h1><p>图数据库的 Schema 设计是艺术与工程的结合。不同于关系型数据库有严格的范式理论，图建模更依赖对<strong>查询访问模式</strong>的深刻理解。本文系统梳理核心设计模式和常见反模式，帮助你在实际项目中做出合理的建模决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询驱动设计</td>\n<td>图建模的核心原则：存储结构应使最重要的查询尽可能高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点粒度</td>\n<td>何时将概念建为节点、何时建为属性的核心决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系具体化</td>\n<td>将关系提升为节点，允许在「关系」上附加更多属性或关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多标签继承</td>\n<td>LPG 用多标签（如 :Person:Employee:Manager）模拟类型继承层次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时态建模</td>\n<td>处理属性或关系随时间变化的策略：属性时间戳、历史节点链、版本节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束（Constraint）</td>\n<td>数据完整性保证：唯一约束、非空约束、节点键约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"建模的核心原则\">建模的核心原则</h2><p>在开始设计图 Schema 之前，必须明确<strong>主要查询模式</strong>。图数据库的建模哲学是：<strong>以查询驱动设计（Query-Driven Design）</strong>——存储结构应当使最重要的查询尽可能高效。</p>\n<p>收集主要查询模式的基本问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>图中最常见的实体是什么？</li>\n<li>最常用的遍历路径是什么（哪些关系被频繁跟随）？</li>\n<li>读写比例如何？</li>\n<li>什么规模的子图需要被加载到内存中？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"节点粒度-细化还是合并\">节点粒度：细化还是合并</h2><p><strong>核心决策</strong>：何时应该将一个概念建模为节点，何时建模为属性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"建为节点的信号\">建为节点的信号</h3><p>以下情况应建模为独立节点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>实体可以单独存在且被查询</strong>：如地址可以是员工的属性，但如果需要「找出同一地址的所有员工」，则应建为节点</li>\n<li><strong>实体与多个其他实体相关联</strong>：技能标签被数千名用户引用，建为节点避免属性重复</li>\n<li><strong>实体本身有结构化属性</strong>：地址有街道、城市、邮编等子属性，建为节点更清晰</li>\n<li><strong>实体的关系本身需要被追踪</strong>：事件、交易等需要时序遍历</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 反例：技能作为属性（字符串数组）&#10;CREATE (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;, skills: [&#39;Python&#39;, &#39;Graph&#39;, &#39;ML&#39;]})&#10;-- 问题：无法高效查询「有 Python 技能的所有人」&#10;&#10;-- 正例：技能作为节点&#10;CREATE (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;CREATE (s1:Skill {name: &#39;Python&#39;}), (s2:Skill {name: &#39;Graph&#39;})&#10;CREATE (p)-[:HAS_SKILL {proficiency: &#39;expert&#39;, since: 2018}]-&gt;(s1)&#10;CREATE (p)-[:HAS_SKILL {proficiency: &#39;intermediate&#39;, since: 2022}]-&gt;(s2)&#10;-- 优势：可以高效查询技能网络，关系可携带熟练度信息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 反例：技能作为属性（字符串数组）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p:Person {name: 'Alice', skills: ['Python', 'Graph', 'ML']})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：无法高效查询「有 Python 技能的所有人」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 正例：技能作为节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (s1:Skill {name: 'Python'}), (s2:Skill {name: 'Graph'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:HAS_SKILL {proficiency: 'expert', since: 2018}]->(s1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:HAS_SKILL {proficiency: 'intermediate', since: 2022}]->(s2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 优势：可以高效查询技能网络，关系可携带熟练度信息</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"建为属性的信号\">建为属性的信号</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>简单标量值，仅用于过滤</strong>：年龄、评分等数值型数据</li>\n<li><strong>关系本身的描述信息</strong>：边的权重、时间戳</li>\n<li><strong>枚举类型且不需要进一步关联</strong>：状态（active/inactive）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"关系建模模式\">关系建模模式</h2><h3 id=\"多重边-multigraph\">多重边（Multigraph）</h3><p>图中两个节点之间可以有多条不同类型的边，也可以有多条相同类型的边（只要语义合理）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- Alice 与 Bob 的多种关系&#10;(alice)-[:COLLEAGUE {since: 2020}]-&gt;(bob)&#10;(alice)-[:FRIEND {since: 2018}]-&gt;(bob)&#10;(alice)-[:MENTORED_BY {duration: &#39;2 years&#39;}]-&gt;(bob)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Alice 与 Bob 的多种关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:COLLEAGUE {since: 2020}]->(bob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:FRIEND {since: 2018}]->(bob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:MENTORED_BY {duration: '2 years'}]->(bob)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：相同类型的重复边通常是建模问题的信号。例如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 问题：Alice 购买了 Product P 三次，创建了三条 PURCHASED 边&#10;(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: &#39;2024-01-01&#39;}]-&gt;(p)&#10;(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: &#39;2024-03-15&#39;}]-&gt;(p)&#10;(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: &#39;2024-07-20&#39;}]-&gt;(p)&#10;&#10;-- 更好：引入中间节点表示每次购买事件&#10;(alice)-[:MADE]-&gt;(order1:Order {date: &#39;2024-01-01&#39;, amount: 99.0})-[:CONTAINS]-&gt;(p)&#10;(alice)-[:MADE]-&gt;(order2:Order {date: &#39;2024-03-15&#39;, amount: 149.0})-[:CONTAINS]-&gt;(p)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：Alice 购买了 Product P 三次，创建了三条 PURCHASED 边</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: '2024-01-01'}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: '2024-03-15'}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:PURCHASED {date: '2024-07-20'}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 更好：引入中间节点表示每次购买事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:MADE]->(order1:Order {date: '2024-01-01', amount: 99.0})-[:CONTAINS]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:MADE]->(order2:Order {date: '2024-03-15', amount: 149.0})-[:CONTAINS]->(p)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关系具体化-reification-pattern\">关系具体化（Reification Pattern）</h3><p>当需要在一条关系上附加更多信息，或者「关系」本身需要被查询时，将关系提升为节点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Person: Alice] --&gt;|HAS_ROLE| R1[Role: Manager since 2020]&#10;    R1 --&gt;|AT| C[Company: TechCorp]&#10;    A --&gt;|HAS_ROLE| R2[Role: Advisor since 2022]&#10;    R2 --&gt;|AT| C\">graph LR\n    A[Person: Alice] --&gt;|HAS_ROLE| R1[Role: Manager since 2020]\n    R1 --&gt;|AT| C[Company: TechCorp]\n    A --&gt;|HAS_ROLE| R2[Role: Advisor since 2022]\n    R2 --&gt;|AT| C</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 直接关系：无法记录 Alice 在 TechCorp 的多个角色&#10;(alice)-[:WORKS_AT {title: &#39;Manager&#39;}]-&gt;(techcorp)&#10;&#10;-- 关系具体化：Role 节点携带丰富信息&#10;CREATE (alice)-[:HAS_ROLE]-&gt;(role:Role {title: &#39;Manager&#39;, since: 2020})&#10;CREATE (role)-[:AT]-&gt;(techcorp)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 直接关系：无法记录 Alice 在 TechCorp 的多个角色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:WORKS_AT {title: 'Manager'}]->(techcorp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 关系具体化：Role 节点携带丰富信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (alice)-[:HAS_ROLE]->(role:Role {title: 'Manager', since: 2020})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (role)-[:AT]->(techcorp)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"中间节点模式-intermediary-node-pattern\">中间节点模式（Intermediary Node Pattern）</h3><p>用于表达多对多关系中的「参与」语义，中间节点携带参与的属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 电影参演：演员-角色-电影三元关系&#10;CREATE (alice:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:PLAYS]-&gt;(char:Character {name: &#39;Neo&#39;})&#10;CREATE (char)-[:IN]-&gt;(movie:Movie {title: &#39;The Matrix&#39;})&#10;-- 或更简洁：&#10;CREATE (role:Role {character: &#39;Neo&#39;, billing: 1})&#10;CREATE (alice)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(role)&#10;CREATE (role)-[:IN]-&gt;(movie)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 电影参演：演员-角色-电影三元关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (alice:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:PLAYS]->(char:Character {name: 'Neo'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (char)-[:IN]->(movie:Movie {title: 'The Matrix'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 或更简洁：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (role:Role {character: 'Neo', billing: 1})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (alice)-[:ACTED_IN]->(role)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (role)-[:IN]->(movie)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时态图建模\">时态图建模</h2><h3 id=\"属性时效性\">属性时效性</h3><p>当节点或关系的属性随时间变化时，有多种处理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：直接属性+时间戳</strong>（适合变化不频繁）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"(p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;, city: &#39;Shanghai&#39;, cityUpdatedAt: datetime(&#39;2024-06-01&#39;)})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(p:Person {name: 'Alice', city: 'Shanghai', cityUpdatedAt: datetime('2024-06-01')})</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：历史节点链（Linked List）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 当前状态&#10;(p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:LIVES_IN {from: date(&#39;2024-06-01&#39;)}]-&gt;(city:City {name: &#39;Shanghai&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 历史状态&#10;(p)-[:LIVED_IN {from: date(&#39;2020-01-01&#39;), to: date(&#39;2024-05-31&#39;)}]-&gt;(prevCity:City {name: &#39;Beijing&#39;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 当前状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:LIVES_IN {from: date('2024-06-01')}]->(city:City {name: 'Shanghai'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 历史状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(p)-[:LIVED_IN {from: date('2020-01-01'), to: date('2024-05-31')}]->(prevCity:City {name: 'Beijing'})</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略三：版本节点</strong>（适合频繁变化的复杂对象）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"(p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;-[:HAS_STATE {from: datetime(&#39;2024-06-01&#39;)}]&#10;-&gt;(state:PersonState {city: &#39;Shanghai&#39;, job: &#39;Engineer&#39;, salary: 50000})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(p:Person {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-[:HAS_STATE {from: datetime('2024-06-01')}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>->(state:PersonState {city: 'Shanghai', job: 'Engineer', salary: 50000})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"时态边\">时态边</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 用边属性记录时效性&#10;(a)-[:MEMBER_OF {from: date(&#39;2020-01-01&#39;), to: date(&#39;2023-12-31&#39;), role: &#39;Developer&#39;}]-&gt;(team)&#10;&#10;-- 查询某时间点的有效成员&#10;MATCH (a)-[m:MEMBER_OF]-&gt;(team:Team {name: &#39;Backend&#39;})&#10;WHERE m.from &lt;= date(&#39;2022-06-01&#39;) AND (m.to IS NULL OR m.to &gt;= date(&#39;2022-06-01&#39;))&#10;RETURN a.name, m.role\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 用边属性记录时效性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(a)-[:MEMBER_OF {from: date('2020-01-01'), to: date('2023-12-31'), role: 'Developer'}]->(team)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查询某时间点的有效成员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a)-[m:MEMBER_OF]->(team:Team {name: 'Backend'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE m.from &#x3C;= date('2022-06-01') AND (m.to IS NULL OR m.to >= date('2022-06-01'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN a.name, m.role</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"schema-层次化-标签继承\">Schema 层次化：标签继承</h2><p>LPG 原生不支持节点类型继承，但可以用多标签模拟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 多标签模拟继承&#10;CREATE (bob:Person:Employee:Manager {name: &#39;Bob&#39;, empId: &#39;E001&#39;, reports: 5})&#10;&#10;-- 所有员工（包括普通员工和经理）&#10;MATCH (e:Employee) RETURN e.name&#10;&#10;-- 只查经理&#10;MATCH (m:Manager) RETURN m.name, m.reports\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 多标签模拟继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (bob:Person:Employee:Manager {name: 'Bob', empId: 'E001', reports: 5})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 所有员工（包括普通员工和经理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (e:Employee) RETURN e.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 只查经理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (m:Manager) RETURN m.name, m.reports</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见建模反模式\">常见建模反模式</h2><h3 id=\"反模式一-基因组反模式-generic-relationship\">反模式一：基因组反模式（Generic Relationship）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 反例：用 RELATED_TO 表达所有关系&#10;(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: &#39;knows&#39;}]-&gt;(bob)&#10;(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: &#39;works_with&#39;}]-&gt;(charlie)&#10;(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: &#39;manages&#39;}]-&gt;(david)&#10;&#10;-- 问题：无法利用关系类型索引，查询需要额外过滤属性&#10;-- 正例：用具体的关系类型&#10;(alice)-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(bob)&#10;(alice)-[:WORKS_WITH]-&gt;(charlie)&#10;(alice)-[:MANAGES]-&gt;(david)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 反例：用 RELATED_TO 表达所有关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: 'knows'}]->(bob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: 'works_with'}]->(charlie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:RELATED_TO {type: 'manages'}]->(david)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：无法利用关系类型索引，查询需要额外过滤属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 正例：用具体的关系类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:KNOWS]->(bob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:WORKS_WITH]->(charlie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:MANAGES]->(david)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"反模式二-属性覆盖反模式-property-overload\">反模式二：属性覆盖反模式（Property Overload）</h3><p>将本应是节点的数据塞进属性（通常是 JSON 或字符串数组），导致无法高效查询。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反模式三-关系类型爆炸\">反模式三：关系类型爆炸</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 反例：将分类信息编码进关系类型&#10;(alice)-[:LIKES_ACTION]-&gt;(movie)&#10;(alice)-[:LIKES_COMEDY]-&gt;(movie)&#10;(alice)-[:LIKES_DRAMA]-&gt;(movie)&#10;&#10;-- 问题：无法动态查询所有 LIKES_* 关系；关系类型是静态的&#10;-- 正例：genre 作为 Movie 的属性或独立节点&#10;(alice)-[:LIKES]-&gt;(movie:Movie {genre: &#39;action&#39;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 反例：将分类信息编码进关系类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:LIKES_ACTION]->(movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:LIKES_COMEDY]->(movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:LIKES_DRAMA]->(movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：无法动态查询所有 LIKES_* 关系；关系类型是静态的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 正例：genre 作为 Movie 的属性或独立节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(alice)-[:LIKES]->(movie:Movie {genre: 'action'})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"反模式四-隐式建模\">反模式四：隐式建模</h3><p>不要在节点或边上使用意义模糊的通用属性，如 <code>{status: &#39;active&#39;, type: &#39;user&#39;, category: 3}</code>，这些值失去了图结构的语义表达力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-迁移\">Schema 迁移</h2><p>图数据库通常是 Schema-optional 的，但这不意味着可以无视 Schema 管理。实践中推荐：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>用 APOC 或自定义 Cypher 脚本执行迁移</strong>：和关系型数据库的迁移脚本类似，保留迁移历史</li>\n<li><strong>采用向前兼容策略</strong>：新增属性/标签不破坏旧查询</li>\n<li><strong>建立约束保证数据完整性</strong>：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 唯一约束&#10;CREATE CONSTRAINT person_email_unique FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.email IS UNIQUE&#10;&#10;-- 非空约束（Neo4j 5.x+）&#10;CREATE CONSTRAINT person_name_not_null FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.name IS NOT NULL&#10;&#10;-- 节点键约束（唯一 + 非空）&#10;CREATE CONSTRAINT person_key FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE (p.name, p.birthDate) IS NODE KEY\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 唯一约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE CONSTRAINT person_email_unique FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.email IS UNIQUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 非空约束（Neo4j 5.x+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE CONSTRAINT person_name_not_null FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.name IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 节点键约束（唯一 + 非空）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE CONSTRAINT person_key FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE (p.name, p.birthDate) IS NODE KEY</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>图 Schema 设计没有绝对正确的答案，但有明确的方向：以查询驱动设计，权衡节点粒度，善用关系具体化处理复杂语义，用时态建模记录历史变化，用多标签模拟继承层次，通过约束保证数据完整性。最重要的是认识和避免反模式——通用关系类型、属性过载、关系类型爆炸是图数据库项目最常见的设计债务。建立可版本控制的 Schema 迁移流程，确保图结构随业务演进而保持健康。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>查询性能优化：建立索引、分析执行计划、处理超节点</li>\n<li>Neo4j 工程实践：Bolt 协议、APOC 扩展库和 GDS 图数据科学库的使用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图 Schema 设计模式","id":"图-schema-设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"建模的核心原则","id":"建模的核心原则"},{"level":2,"text":"节点粒度：细化还是合并","id":"节点粒度-细化还是合并"},{"level":3,"text":"建为节点的信号","id":"建为节点的信号"},{"level":3,"text":"建为属性的信号","id":"建为属性的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"关系建模模式","id":"关系建模模式"},{"level":3,"text":"多重边（Multigraph）","id":"多重边-multigraph"},{"level":3,"text":"关系具体化（Reification Pattern）","id":"关系具体化-reification-pattern"},{"level":3,"text":"中间节点模式（Intermediary Node Pattern）","id":"中间节点模式-intermediary-node-pattern"},{"level":2,"text":"时态图建模","id":"时态图建模"},{"level":3,"text":"属性时效性","id":"属性时效性"},{"level":3,"text":"时态边","id":"时态边"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 层次化：标签继承","id":"schema-层次化-标签继承"},{"level":2,"text":"常见建模反模式","id":"常见建模反模式"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式一：基因组反模式（Generic Relationship）","id":"反模式一-基因组反模式-generic-relationship"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式二：属性覆盖反模式（Property Overload）","id":"反模式二-属性覆盖反模式-property-overload"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式三：关系类型爆炸","id":"反模式三-关系类型爆炸"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式四：隐式建模","id":"反模式四-隐式建模"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 迁移","id":"schema-迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"图存储引擎：原生图存储与关系后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/fundamentals/graph-storage-engines"},"next":{"title":"图数据库查询性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/performance-optimization"}}